# Pico SDK platform

The SDK definitions, all four Raspberry Pi Pico SDK board definitions (with
separate Arm and RISC-V declarations for RP2350), vendored library, bridge, and
wrapper that make up the Pico SDK-backed platform. The branch is non-core with a
lock: the wrapper names a third-party library, and a core node may not.
rp2040-ram and rp2350-ram stay outside this directory because they are
project-linked core platforms that do not depend on Pico SDK.
